":"paragraph","text":"ええと、盛りだくさん過ぎて\n何から書けば良いのか..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！早速噛みました泣\nそして、みなみ。\n批判してごめんよ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真洋とからだを張ったゲームにも\n挑戦したり...生電話したり...\n楽しかった！\n真洋と一緒に出れて嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ、またおじゃましたいです♪\n下北最高っ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番好きな動物は？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"主に爬虫類！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"109で買い物とかする？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんまり行ったことないなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"竹下通りのフードコートがある\nところいったことある？！\nタピオカとかあるところ♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あるよー♪タピオカ美味"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旅行に行きたい国は何処ですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モロッコ、メキシコ、イギリス、フランス"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイド喫茶とか行ったことある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ないない！\nあったらびっくりするでしょ？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかは活動的なイメージが\nあるので、ひきこもってるイメージが\nないんですが、ひきこもってるときは\n家でなにしてますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"主に寝ていますが、\n雑誌読んだり漫画読んだり本読んだり\n作ったり掃除したり...\n割と家の中でも活発だよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"携帯なくなっても生きていける？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今はないと生きていけないけど、\nたぶんなくても生活できる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木神社でお守りを買った？\nもし、持っていたら何色ですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緑！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トマトの他にも、\n何か克服したものってありますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アボカド。もうだいすきなの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うどん好きですか??"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"麺類だったら何が一番好き？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うどん消化に良くて美味しくて\nだいすき"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、そばもラーメンも\nそうめんもだいすき。\nすすれるすすれない関係ない！\n食べられたらいいんだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段の生活で\nスタイルを維持させるように\n心がけてることはなんですか(*･ω･*)？\nまたおすすめのダイエット方は\nありますか(*･ω･*)？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マッサージとストレッチは\n毎日寝る前にしてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"野菜魚豆を中心に食べる...とか？\n水をたくさん飲むとか。\n頑張ってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなドレッシングとか\n調味料って何ですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポン酢、ごま油、きなこ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝弱い俺なんだけど\nどーすればいーー？笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じく～\nどーすればいい？泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひさびさに握手にいっても温かく\n出迎えてもらえますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろんよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれるの嬉しいよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼のびのび乃木坂／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"GiRLPOP TV\n昨日、見てくださった方\nありがとうございました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はあみ、れなと\nトリックアート展でのびのび。\n今日の25:30からも放送するので\n見ていない方はぜひ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4月6日に開催される\n「アオーレ1周年誕生祭」に\n乃木坂46が出演します。\n私も出演します"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公開生放送にも出演します。\nNST新潟総合テレビ「スマイルスタジアムNST ～アオーレ長岡1周年誕生祭SP～」\n4月6日(土)10:30～11:25 放送予定 \n出演メンバー：伊藤万理華、衛藤美彩、中元日芽香"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ遊びに来てください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして！\n全握のレーンが発表されましたー\n第14レーン:伊藤万理華/井上小百合"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃん！\nふほほほ楽しみ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/04/8420511/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いじろう←\nサユリストのみなさん\nどうぞよろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日で400回更新だ！\n早いもんだね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-nogi-39596":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"   お疲れ様です、桃子です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHETQMY5MXJR2JD8GNHH83A4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">   昨日と今日は神宮球場でのライブでした まだライブが終わったばっかりで頭がこんがらがってるままなので感想は次のブログに書きたいと思います笑  夜空とみなさんが振ってくれたサイリウムがとっても素敵で芸術的な感じがとても感動しました！！楽しかった〜〜✨そう！楽しかったです！     17枚目シングル最後の全国握手会ありがとうございました！！ 久しぶりのミニライブで、三番目の風を披露できて楽しかったです！！ 握手のペアは、あやのちゃんでした^ ^あやのちゃんはポワンってしてると思うけど、いがいにお姉さんで本当に優しくていい感じなんですよ！( ˊ̱˂˃ˋ̱ )ファンの方の笑顔で笑顔になりました次はアルバムの握手会ですね、今から楽しみです！！    会いたいなーーーーーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHETQP0KQG72YGWSVYN29C9E","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">  ももももも〜いい夢みれますように    おやすみなさい    "}],"source":"archive"},"sba-nogi-51094":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"  \n  仙台での個別握手会おわりました！\n  ありがとうございました！\n  \n  お花の写真はまた後日掲載します☺︎\n  \n  \n  \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFCW17NJ9GZ85KERZ9ZFY0H","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  そして今日は\n  Qさま！！でお世話になっている\n  さまぁ〜ず 三村さんのお誕生日！\n  おめでとうございます！\n  \n  番組に初めて出させて頂いた頃から\n  現場に居やすいように\n  たくさんいじってくださって、\n  そのおかげでどんなに緊張していても\n  常に楽しんで出演できています！\n  クイズ自体は難しいし真剣そのものだけど\n  なにより毎回現場に行くのが楽しみです。\n  \n  これからも宜しくお願い致します！\n  \n  \n  \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFCW2J6M52K9SVX57STAQSZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  番組スタッフさんが用意されていたケーキ\n  かわいかった〜〜\n  \n  \n  4期生の筒井あやめちゃんも、\n  今日がお誕生日みたいです✨\n  おめでとう！\n  \n  生誕祭でたくさんの人の前で話すのも\n  緊張したと思うけれど\n  すごくしっかりしていました☺︎\n  うわぁ写真撮ればよかった...！後悔！\n  また今度チャンスがあったら！\n  \n  \n  \n  れな\n  \n  "}],"source":"archive"},"ofc-s46-71545":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小田倉麗奈(おだくられいな)です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、大人になりたくないって呟いたら、あなたはもう立派な大人だよって言われました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういうことじゃないのに( -᷅\"-᷄ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"取り繕わない日常が子どもの特権ではなくて、大人になっても続くものだといいなって思っていたんだよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無責任に未来を語ったり、休日を無駄で埋めたり、締切直前に大焦りで徹夜したり……"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういう意味のないことにこそ意味があったんだねって言いたかったんだ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人も楽しい事ばかりだといいなぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事終わりに凪美青と集合してディズニーに行ってきました！楽しかった！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mob0SPB3g.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか友だちみたいだなって思ってるんだ\nありがとうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobCjjKxt.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サングラスかけて一旦こっち見るの何？笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobUeX8ZB.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobqJVAIN.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レイヤーをたくさん入れてもらいました\nライブとかでフワッとさせたい願望"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobY0dTUo.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"背の高い建造物が少ないと景観が良いとはこういうことか！っていつも思うんだよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10/14(水)に16th Single『愛MUST BE』が発売されました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobHf7ZoR.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自称バレエダンサーと1mmも飛ばない鳥に参加させていただいています"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自称バレエダンサーは、YouTubeでもMVを見てくださってありがとうございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どちらもみなさんに披露するのが楽しみです\nぜひたくさん聴いてください♩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobK5sYAh.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りかちゃんの膝に乗せてもらった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャケ写の空いた時間に三期生みんなで動画を撮ったり写真を撮ったりしていました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それぞれが撮った面白い動画や写真を送りあっていてずっと賑やかだったな〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛おしいよーーーー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し遡りますが……"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobKMJ6H4.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15th Single京都リアミでいただいた素敵なお花たち"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとうございます！\n休憩の度にお花を見て、みなさんの大きな愛を感じています"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部大切な宝物ですꕤ︎︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"JR東日本さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobmKzWQb.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"江ノ島に行った時に見つけました\n嬉しくてポスターと一緒に撮っちゃった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"等身大パネルがある駅もあるので、ぜひ見つけて一緒に写真を撮ってみてください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、明日はミーグリ＆ハロウィンだね！\nみなさんにお会いできるのが楽しみです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#reinablog\n#おだくらさんの日記"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またね"}],"source":"official"}}